  "prefLabel": "Mavs 103.06 Division of Veterans Services",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mavs 103.06 Division of Veterans Services. The division of veterans services shall assist veterans who are residents of this state or their dependents to secure all benefits to which they may be entitled under any state or federal laws or regulations.\n\nSource. #13459-A, eff 10-14-22",
